            "author": {
                "name": "anatawa12",
                "url": "https://github.com/anatawa12"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added firefox support (with flag) for <code class=\"notranslate\">attr(x type(&lt;types&gt;))</code></li>\n<li>Removed browser support <code class=\"notranslate\">attr(x type(&lt;url&gt;))</code> as it is <a href=\"https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/www-style/2025Sep/0017.html#:~:text=PROPOSED:%20Make%20type(%3Curl%3E)%20invalid%20in%20the%20attr()%20function%20(for%20now)\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>not</strong> supported in any browser</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested all the <code class=\"notranslate\">attr(x type(&lt;types&gt;))</code> using the the <a href=\"https://codepen.io/collection/GpWYMN\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodePens in  this collection</a> in the following Firefox Browsers with the <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.attr.enabled</code> flag:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 149.0b3 (aarch64)</li>\n<li>Firefox Nightly 150.0a1 (2026-03-02)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested the <code class=\"notranslate\">attr(x type(&lt;url&gt;))</code> with <a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/jEMWpoM\" rel=\"nofollow\">this Codepen</a> in these browsers and all failed:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome 145.0.7632.160</li>\n<li>Edge 145.0.3800.82</li>\n<li>Safari 26.2 (20623.1.14.18.4)</li>\n<li>Firefox Beta 149.0b3 (aarch64) (with flag)</li>\n<li>Firefox Nightly 150.0a1 (2026-03-02) (with flag)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43340\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43340/hovercard\">Firefox release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
