        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32498324?u=33625fe335fbb6a8a62271bcc211afc447904e8a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari Tech Preview 238 supports most of customisable select</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://webkit.org/blog/17848/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-238/#:~:text=appearance%3A%20base%2Dselect\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/blog/17848/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-238/#:~:text=appearance%3A%20base%2Dselect</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">::checkmark</code> deliberately hasn't been marked as supported as there's a bug in the current tech preview where it doesn't actually work. It should be fixed in the next one but for now I'll leave it as false.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
